        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Extremes currently dominate the electorate.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Mandatory voting causes discomfort among citizens.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Non-voters who are most at risk of being marginalized tend to be Democrats.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
