        "text": "Without a system of winnowing, every candidate could run in a single election.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "If everyone ran in one election, someone could win with only 12% of the vote.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The goal of the electoral system should be a majority of voters selecting their representative.",
