      },
      {
        "text": "Audiences understand and value transparency in campaign financing.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Political outcomes should reflect the will of ordinary citizens rather than concentrated elite interests.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The existence of large disparities in contribution size indicates systemic corruption or bias.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker has moral authority to critique campaign finance due to perceived civic responsibility.",
