    "turn_text": "remember Arkansas used to have this horrible term limits. It was six years. And for those who are familiar, the Arkansas legislature, they only meet every other year. And it's a lifetime ban. Okay, so you're literally like in high school thinking, I think I want to be speaker. So we worked with a group to recreate term limits. The first time they ended up succeeding the second time, we had this thing called support. We knew we had to get a yes vote. because we passed in called term limits that work and it went down two to one because people did not want longer terms because they were like this guy it's like I'm just so mad I want all of you gone even if it means when you get there I want you gone again we",
